{
  "slug": "phasefolio",
  "name": "Phasefolio",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "PhaseFolio brings risk-adjusted NPV (rNPV) modeling and biotech diligence into Claude Code. Value clinical-stage assets across the full development pipeline, look up published probabilities of success by indication, modality, and biomarker, scan competitive landscapes from ClinicalTrials.gov and FDA Drugs@FDA, and verify signed PhaseFolio export signatures - all from natural-language prompts. Every output ships with embedded engine, methodology, and benchmark versions, so any number you produce is reproducible by a counterparty reviewing your work.",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install phasefolio@claude-community` from `TamalAdebisi/phasefolio-claude-plugin`.\n\nPhaseFolio is a financial-modeling platform for biotech assets — risk-adjusted NPV (rNPV), competitive landscape, evidence registers, and signed IC dossiers. This plugin connects Claude to PhaseFolio's read-only MCP API so you can pull projects, scenarios, dossiers, and benchmarks into the conversation, and verify signed reports — without leaving your terminal.",
